goome is header only. In exactly one .c file:

    #define GOOME_IMPLEMENTATION
    #include <goome.h>

    find_path(GOOME_INCLUDE_DIRS "goome.h")
    target_include_directories(main PRIVATE ${GOOME_INCLUDE_DIRS})
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE ${CMAKE_DL_LIBS})

The backends (goome_glfw.h, goome_gl3.h, goome_dx11.h and the rest) are in the same folder.
